WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:04.528
Where to use Jev: can one option read another?

00:00:04.528 --> 00:00:07.370
Four questions, in order, from eighteen measured pieces.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.687
The first three gates.

00:00:09.687 --> 00:00:11.767
Answer set finite before the call?

00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:13.847
Can code you own enumerate it?

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:15.928
